\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces $\Delta $ valid molecules out of 2048 (\texttt  {marginal} $-$ \texttt  {edlm}), 5 seeds; bold marks $|\Delta | > 2.5\,\mathrm  {se}$. The validity cost of per-position mixing is confirmed only at $\lambda =20$, $k\ge 4$, large $N$ (and $\lambda =200$, $N=1000$, $k=8$). Cells where \texttt  {marginal} comes out ahead reach at most $t=+1.4$, i.e. none of them is distinguishable from zero --- the mixed signs elsewhere are noise on a standard error of 5--20 counts.}}{7}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:fs-delta-valid}{{5}{7}{$\Delta $ valid molecules out of 2048 (\texttt {marginal} $-$ \texttt {edlm}), 5 seeds; bold marks $|\Delta | > 2.5\,\mathrm {se}$. The validity cost of per-position mixing is confirmed only at $\lambda =20$, $k\ge 4$, large $N$ (and $\lambda =200$, $N=1000$, $k=8$). Cells where \texttt {marginal} comes out ahead reach at most $t=+1.4$, i.e. none of them is distinguishable from zero --- the mixed signs elsewhere are noise on a standard error of 5--20 counts}{table.5}{}}
